{"skill":{"slug":"openclaw-tavily-search","displayName":"Tavily Search"},"version":{"version":"0.2.1","createdAt":1789379090613,"changelog":"Least-privilege maintenance: the script now reads TAVILY_API_KEY only from the host environment, no longer opens OpenClaw credential files, and CI uses current Node 24-based actions.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3220,"sha256":"d3f1761279ee53cd6d11d5b009d368f7f4c2f97dbc0405a2931aa4e6e6952cef","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/tavily_search.py","size":9233,"sha256":"f026cee5fbce2a3a2575f64ffe86f0769a6f2377b252516488f64aa1f4390f4c","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1907,"sha256":"d84e4cb3cd1b0b6b4d1fa81de755c65ec14f6b57a37ac66d5af6f6d7430ddbda","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789382904434,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"38734c8dd36f07a416712afea7753d1f5d455e1075caccbacd62ab43e66a7cac","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/38734c8dd36f07a416712afea7753d1f5d455e1075caccbacd62ab43e66a7cac","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1789381907256},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":86,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1789382904434},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Tavily web-search helper whose network and API-key use match its stated purpose.","dimensions":[{"detail":"It requires outbound HTTPS to api.tavily.com and TAVILY_API_KEY, which is proportionate for a Tavily integration and disclosed in metadata and configuration text.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill consists of SKILL.md and one bundled Python script, with no install hook, package installation step, remote code loading, or dependency execution path.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Runtime instructions are narrow: form a search query, run the bundled script, treat snippets as untrusted, open sources before factual claims, and cite sources.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, credential-file reads, privilege escalation, tool modification, or local data indexing were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact coherently implements public web search through Tavily and returns structured results; it explicitly says not to use it for private or authenticated pages.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to use Tavily for web search and are comfortable sending search queries, domain filters, and your Tavily API key to Tavily's API. Do not use it for private, authenticated, or sensitive queries.","findings":"[TT3] expected: The TAVILY_API_KEY environment value is used as the Authorization header for the documented Tavily API request, not sent to an unrelated endpoint.\n[LP3] expected: The skill declares its required environment variable and python3 binary and documents the Tavily API destination; tighter host-enforced network scoping would be useful but the artifact behavior is disclosed and purpose-aligned.\n[E1] expected: External transmission to https://api.tavily.com/search is necessary for the stated public web-search capability and is disclosed.\n[SQP-2] expected: Search queries and domain filters are sent to Tavily, and SKILL.md explicitly discloses that data flow; users should avoid submitting sensitive private queries.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789382904434}}}}}